Why a update?!
--------------

Did'nt u just LOOOOVE the MagicArc door for Daydream? Oh yes it was
goodie! BUT! And thats a BIG BUT! It didn't exit properly!! And after
a while the computer guru'd!... to bad! Another thing was a limited
adds to be stripped.. and no support for .DMS files?... This update
(tuneup) takes care of all that....

What's New?
-----------

* New Design, with a nice "progressbar" from 0% - 100%
* DMS checking added (with MAPUS.. ;)
* Unlimited adds to be stripped!!!
* Can only add 1 add! (STOP THE ADDFLOOD!!)
* Faster Stripping!
* Realy nice design... :)
* Realy small doorcode! (~4k!)

Why use REAL CHECK?!
--------------------

Well... Magic Arc was great!!... but Real Check is greater.. :) One program
thats takes care of all adding/stripping of any file (supports: LHA/LZH/LZX
/DMS/TXT/DOC/NFO). It's kind'a fast to.... and have a terrific design!!

Install & cfg!
--------------

Copy           To                 What?
------------------------------------------------------
REALCHECK.DD   DOORS:REXXDIR/     Main Door..
REALCHECK.CFG  DAYDREAM:CONFIGS/  CFG file..
REALCHECK.DOC  DAYDREAM:DOCS/     This file, stoopid! :)
RC.STRIPFILE   S:                 Adds to be stripped..

Just add the line      "DOORS:REXX %N DOORS:REXXDIR/REALCHECK.DD" 
to the                 "DAYDREAM:[CONF]/DATA/EXAMINE.DAT" file...

then edit the          "DAYDREAM:CONFIGS/REALCHECK.CFG" file..
you can also edit the  "S:RC.STRIPFILE" .....

Then force a user to upload something :)



                                /Alcatraz!